sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant App as Your Application
    participant BetterAuth as Better Auth<br/>(Session)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Okta as Okta IdP
    participant Databricks as Databricks<br/>Workspace

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over User,Okta: Phase 1: User SSO Login
        User->>App: Login Request
        App->>Okta: OAuth 2.0 Authorization
        Okta->>User: Authenticate (MFA, etc.)
        Okta-->>App: ID Token + Access Token
        App->>BetterAuth: Create Session
        BetterAuth->>DB: Store session
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over App,Databricks: Phase 2: SPN Token Acquisition
        User->>App: Access Databricks Feature
        App->>BetterAuth: Validate Session
        BetterAuth-->>App: User Identity (email)
        App->>DB: Query userSpns table<br/>(lookup by email)
        DB-->>App: SPN Credentials<br/>(clientId, clientSecret)
        App->>Databricks: POST /oidc/v1/token<br/>grant_type=client_credentials<br/>scope=all-apis
        Databricks-->>App: Workspace Access Token
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over App,Databricks: Phase 3: API Calls with SPN Token
        App->>Databricks: API Request<br/>Authorization: Bearer {token}
        Databricks-->>App: API Response
        App-->>User: Render Data
    end

    Note over User,Databricks: User never sees Databricks login<br/>All API calls use mapped SPN
